<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Flixstar is a popular streaming platform that offers a vast library of movies, TV shows, and original content, catering to diverse entertainment preferences. Designed for seamless viewing, it supports high-quality streaming in HD and 4K, along with offline downloads for on-the-go access. The platform features personalized recommendations based on user preferences, multi-device compatibility, and flexible subscription plans, including ad-supported free tiers and premium ad-free options. With a focus on both mainstream blockbusters and niche genres, Flixstar aims to provide an engaging and user-friendly experience for film and TV enthusiasts. Additionally, it may include social features like user reviews, ratings, and curated watchlists, making it a comprehensive hub for entertainment discovery and enjoyment. Whether for binge-watching, casual viewing, or exploring new releases, Flixstar strives to be a top choice for streaming audiences.">
    <title>Flixstar</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-red: #e50914;
            --primary-red-dark: #b2070f;
            --dark-bg: #141414;
            --dark-bg-light: #222;
            --light-text: #ffffff;
            --light-text-dim: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            --dark-text: #000000;
            --gray-text: #999999;
            --card-bg: #2f2f2f;
            --card-bg-hover: #3f3f3f;
            --transition-fast: 0.2s ease;
            --transition-medium: 0.3s ease;
            --transition-slow: 0.5s ease;
            --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            --shadow-lg: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--light-text);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4%;
            height: 68px;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
        }

        .header.scrolled {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            height: 60px;
        }

        .logo {
            color: var(--primary-red);
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .logo:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .nav-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin-left: 40px;
        }

        .search-container {
            position: relative;
            margin-left: 900px;
            flex-grow: 1;
            max-width: 300px;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--light-text);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            white-space: nowrap;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -2px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            transition: width var(--transition-medium);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--light-text);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .search-input {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            width: 100%;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .search-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            border-color: var(--primary-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);
        }

        .search-results {
            position: absolute;
            top: calc(100% + 5px);
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-text);
            border-radius: 4px;
            max-height: 400px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }

        .search-results.active {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .search-result-item {
            padding: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-bg);
            transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .search-result-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .search-result-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
        }

        .search-result-item img {
            width: 40px;
            height: 60px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .search-result-item:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .search-result-info {
            flex: 1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .search-result-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        .search-result-meta {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gray-text);
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .search-result-meta span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 3px;
        }

        .movie-views {
            color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            height: 100vh;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4%;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--dark-bg) 0%, transparent 90%),
                        linear-gradient(to right, var(--dark-bg) 10%, transparent 90%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            z-index: 0;
            transition: transform 10s linear;
        }

        .hero:hover .hero-bg {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 40%;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s var(--transition-slow) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            color: var(--light-text-dim);
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .hero-btn {
            padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            transform: translateY(0);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .hero-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .hero-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(1px);
        }

        .play-btn {
            background-color: white;
            color: var(--dark-text);
            border: none;
        }

        .play-btn:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }

        .info-btn {
            background-color: rgba(109, 109, 110, 0.7);
            color: white;
            border: none;
        }

        .info-btn:hover {
            background-color: rgba(109, 109, 110, 0.9);
        }

        .rows-container {
            padding: 0 4%;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            margin-top: -10rem;
        }

        .row {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease forwards;
        }

        .row:nth-child(1) {
            animation-delay: 0.3s;
        }
        .row:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.5s;
        }
        .row:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 0.7s;
        }

        .row-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            position: relative;
        }

        .row-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .slider-container {
            position: relative;
        }

        .slider {
            display: flex;
            overflow-x: auto;
            overflow-y: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }

        .slider::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        .slider-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 50px;
            height: 80px;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 4px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
        }

        .slider-arrow.left {
            left: 0;
            transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(-10px);
        }

        .slider-arrow.right {
            right: 0;
            transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(10px);
        }

        .slider-container:hover .slider-arrow {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(0);
        }

        .slider-arrow:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            width: 55px;
        }

        .movie-card {
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            width: 220px;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .movie-card:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1) translateY(-10px);
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }

        .movie-poster {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: block;
            transition: transform var(--transition-slow);
        }

        .movie-card:hover .movie-poster {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .movie-info {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9) 0%, transparent 100%);
            padding: 1rem;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            transform: translateY(10px);
        }

        .movie-card:hover .movie-info {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .movie-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .movie-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gray-text);
        }

        .movie-views {
            color: var(--primary-red);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 3px;
        }

        .ranking-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            z-index: 2;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            border: 2px solid white;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .rank-1 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #c5a600);
            color: #000;
        }

        .rank-2 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c0c0c0, #a0a0a0);
            color: #000;
        }

        .rank-3 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cd7f32, #a05a1a);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .movie-card:hover .ranking-badge {
            transform: scale(1.2) translateY(-5px);
        }

        .see-all-btn {
            background-color: rgba(47, 47, 47, 0.5);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 10px;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .see-all-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .back-to-browse {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .back-to-browse:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-red-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .auth-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            z-index: 2000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-medium);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .auth-modal.active {
            display: flex;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .auth-container {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            position: relative;
            transform: scale(0.9);
            transition: transform var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--primary-red);
        }

        .auth-modal.active .auth-container {
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        .close-auth {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--gray-text);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .close-auth:hover {
            color: var(--primary-red);
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }

        .auth-form {
            display: block;
        }

        .auth-form h2 {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--light-text);
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--light-text-dim);
        }

        .form-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-text);
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: var(--light-text);
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .form-group input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);
        }

        .auth-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .auth-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-red-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .auth-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(1px);
        }

        .user-profile {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
        }

        .user-avatar {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .user-profile:hover .user-avatar {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .user-menu {
            display: none;
            position: absolute;
            top: calc(100% + 10px);
            right: 0;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-text);
            border-radius: 4px;
            min-width: 180px;
            z-index: 1000;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            transition: all var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .user-menu.active {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .user-menu-item {
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            color: var(--light-text);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .user-menu-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding-left: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .user-menu-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: var(--gray-text);
            margin: 0.3rem 0;
        }

        .mobile-search-btn {
            display: none;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .mobile-search-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .mobile-search-container {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 68px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            padding: 15px;
            z-index: 1000;
            transform: translateY(-100%);
            transition: transform var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .mobile-search-container.active {
            display: block;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .notification {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background-color: var(--primary-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            z-index: 3000;
            transform: translateX(200%);
            transition: transform var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .notification.active {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        .notification i {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .loading-spinner {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            z-index: 3000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .loading-spinner.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .spinner {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border: 5px solid rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50%;
            border-top-color: var(--primary-red);
            animation: spin 1s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* New styles for movie details modal */
        .movie-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            z-index: 2000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-medium);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .movie-modal.active {
            display: flex;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .movie-modal-container {
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            border-radius: 8px;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 900px;
            max-height: 90vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            position: relative;
            transform: scale(0.95);
            transition: transform var(--transition-medium);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }

        .movie-modal.active .movie-modal-container {
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        .close-movie-modal {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--gray-text);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color var(--transition-fast);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .close-movie-modal:hover {
            color: var(--primary-red);
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }

        .movie-modal-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .movie-modal-header {
            position: relative;
            height: 400px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .movie-modal-backdrop {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .movie-modal-header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 150px;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--dark-bg) 0%, transparent 100%);
        }

        .movie-modal-info {
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: -100px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .movie-modal-poster {
            width: 200px;
            height: 300px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            object-fit: cover;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .movie-modal-details {
            flex: 1;
        }

